{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026VAv6dJzUG01794970288.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>國家主席習近平出席APEC工商領導人峰會，提到促進亞太共同繁榮，要拓展互利共贏路徑，中方支持成立世界灣區經濟合作聯盟。</p><p></p><p>國家主席習近平說：「亞太地區匯集了世界上最重要的灣區，灣區經濟具有鮮明的開放性、協同性、外溢性，我們所在的深圳，就位於粵港澳大灣區。中方支持成立世界灣區經濟合作聯盟，深化各灣區交流互動，探索亞太經濟合作新路徑。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T03:45:01.745445+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":166,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T02:29:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T08:37:56.334935+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T03:38:22.574360+00:00","content_hash":"8b7c580a271d1975dc65d6ce64110105e2be4a60c2fbf0f9a4f4af7b82fbb2e7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T03:45:01.745445+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}